# without it. The fixture checks a Windows-target build in a scratch worktree
# where the (untracked) sidecar is absent, keeps the Linux refusal as its
# negative control, and pins the release job's runner.arch sidecar selection.
# Pre-fix: arm 1 fails with rc=101 "required runtime asset missing".
#
# STEP_SCRIPT is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
